{
  "Click 'Settings' in the toolbar to configure defaults for all games:": {"translation":"点击工具栏中的“设置”，可配置所有游戏的默认值：","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"3c480fb3aab4fd8d3d3f54b08a1074af992f54f0b3451470b72613153e315ae4"},
  "ReLimiter FPS: Default frame rate target": {"translation":"ReLimiter FPS：默认目标帧率","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"b07e5f8316b189c9477238642dcade06e4d02601d2e9e3d759e3b2de7849003c"},
  "DLSS Preset: Default upscaling preset": {"translation":"DLSS 预设：默认升频预设","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"8c5cb81f20d14dc2f76281b31631793c6e76545009625d809077b172369f0a6e"},
  "NVIDIA Driver Settings: VSync, Low Latency, Power Mode": {"translation":"NVIDIA 驱动设置：垂直同步、低延迟、电源模式","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"df6f53ec2ba7da9ad9dafa08ffc66b0482a16f701a2a7aaa0b4c0b50ee6f2905"},
  "Peak Nits: Your display's peak brightness for HDR": {"translation":"峰值亮度：显示器的 HDR 峰值亮度","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"58a2f98a75e2b1ce69767b5e2bf75972e171ff39f1b9738f7c9931a782a5d0ed"},
  "ReShade Hotkeys: Customize overlay and screenshot keys": {"translation":"ReShade 快捷键：自定义覆盖层和截图按键","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"96c1ae5ab6dade68f6e7125677ced5752a3759b03c937ba45bbbb7174838b57b"},
  "RHI can manage per-game NVIDIA driver profiles. These settings are available directly on each game's detail panel:": {"translation":"RHI 可以管理每个游戏的 NVIDIA 驱动配置文件。以下设置可直接在游戏详情面板中调整：","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"6b294b916b9c5dbb295c0bc922ffb496e4133e75a3fc40fd1bab8eca08408903"},
  "VSync: On, Off, or Adaptive (Fast Sync)": {"translation":"垂直同步：开启、关闭或自适应（Fast Sync）","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"132505e873dcbd69ed05918f86a52aed13e40b7915f56b0c61ee012ea8e03e96"},
  "Low Latency Mode: Ultra, On, or Off": {"translation":"低延迟模式：Ultra、开启或关闭","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"d0a871a395b56d3b216a11bcf94806f30ed9cef0b151c59c9322bf4af4e734e6"},
  "Smooth Motion: Multi Frame Generation (per-game only)": {"translation":"Smooth Motion：多帧生成（仅单游戏）","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"9604b2913c5c3241353a1bb8f3368d8540d5e613b431835bcf01e55ac9da1fdc"},
  "ReBAR: Resizable BAR (requires admin)": {"translation":"ReBAR：Resizable BAR（需要管理员权限）","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"804ed912d8ef127aa16e051fb64de2cab9d428581aa9af5e23ff2851a377a3f3"},
  "Global defaults for VSync, Low Latency, and Power Mode are set in Settings. Per-game overrides are configured directly on each game's detail panel.": {"translation":"垂直同步、低延迟和电源模式的全局默认值可在“设置”中配置。每个游戏的覆盖设置可直接在对应详情面板中调整。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"3313ca2416511bf4538c1d1c51528e95e329761ac021436a1da76f1d05548dc3"},
  "Vulkan Games": {"translation":"Vulkan 游戏","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"12b7f6f30ec446b348141137824a722669df16224d30207eb6b0cd523bfd28ca"},
  "Vulkan games (shown with a 'Vulkan' badge) use a global ReShade layer installed to C:\\ProgramData\\ReShade. This requires administrator privileges. When you install ReShade on a Vulkan game, RHI will prompt for elevation.": {"translation":"Vulkan 游戏（带有“Vulkan”标记）使用安装在 C:\\ProgramData\\ReShade 的全局 ReShade Layer，因此需要管理员权限。在 Vulkan 游戏上安装 ReShade 时，RHI 会请求提权。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"9386ba7591502d2f21d0c80ecfdebd4d4484dfd52adc3323ac3d469f6f9a2cfe"},
  "All Vulkan games share the same ReShade installation. Updating ReShade on one Vulkan game updates it for all.\nPer-game RenoDX addons and shaders are still installed individually to each game folder.": {"translation":"所有 Vulkan 游戏共享同一套 ReShade 安装。更新任意一个 Vulkan 游戏的 ReShade 会同时更新全部 Vulkan 游戏。\n每个游戏的 RenoDX 附加组件和着色器仍会分别安装到各自游戏目录。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"aa51bc1d3aa1a99e57bbb8fe145239441d419b60fd484a6a50cfe602e40cc6e1"},
  "Adding Games Manually": {"translation":"手动添加游戏","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"efca96b62d9533a12fb24fcbf04fd592a2b0cc6991079557e8958ad6b2ea4ffe"},
  "If a game isn't auto-detected, drag and drop its .exe file directly onto the RHI window. RHI will add it to your library and detect its engine type.": {"translation":"如果游戏未被自动检测，可将其 .exe 文件直接拖到 RHI 窗口。RHI 会把它加入游戏库并检测其引擎类型。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"da466bccddcbfce10dd948b4d823240291c216434d79ac29551d0def4cdeba71"},
  "You can also drag .addon64 files from the RenoDX Discord onto any game to install mods not yet on the wiki.": {"translation":"也可以把从 RenoDX Discord 获取的 .addon64 文件拖到任意游戏上，安装尚未收录到 Wiki 的模组。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"e91fd91e8fbe521f02afd0da412b3a529b3bac1291050b1ee93ff85342b869b6"},
  "Updating Everything": {"translation":"全部更新","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"9c84d2a68186af6689486eb564e9aa48c58590a59a71bf732c6a26f661afed51"},
  "Click 'Update All' in the toolbar to update all installed components across all games at once. This includes ReShade, RenoDX mods, ReLimiter, Display Commander, and more.": {"translation":"点击工具栏中的“全部更新”，可一次更新所有游戏中已安装的组件，包括 ReShade、RenoDX 模组、ReLimiter、Display Commander 等。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"8ff3f0e7fcaa72aee43d47ca58dc2532fe4121c18cc9cf54d17cfe261ba591dc"},
  "Games with available updates show a green dot in the sidebar. Configure which components are included in 'Update All' from Settings.": {"translation":"有可用更新的游戏会在侧边栏显示绿色圆点。可在“设置”中配置哪些组件包含在“全部更新”中。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"31d37396d622ba24500723fa2fe05229c7b20a5577a412169cb08df548dd2f9e"},
  "Troubleshooting: Full Refresh": {"translation":"故障排除：完整刷新","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"9917a76d9cb3223341370d59138b74f976314036bdc7db51ad9f527600f3cd2d"},
  "If games are missing, install locations have changed, or DLSS/Streamline files have been added or removed, use 'Full Refresh' in Settings to rescan your entire library from scratch.": {"translation":"如果游戏缺失、安装位置发生变化，或新增/删除了 DLSS/Streamline 文件，可在“设置”中使用“完整刷新”，从头重新扫描整个游戏库。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"2e713ba9e193754f7e87dc174123bb395bc0092a7ede2b075d39ad88ec02b698"},
  "Full Refresh clears the cached game list and re-detects everything. Use it when the normal Refresh button doesn't pick up changes.": {"translation":"“完整刷新”会清除缓存的游戏列表并重新检测全部内容。当普通“刷新”无法发现变化时使用它。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"28386203dea9f5e3cc39d4eb2693f5e553129884558e7ddcb4370184f1949b0a"},
  "System Tray": {"translation":"系统托盘","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"2a2a416f22c1b78b6138d1904f67b680795d09b996684a47e09f217abc062d92"},
  "RHI can minimize to the system tray instead of closing. Right-click the tray icon to quickly launch recent games without opening the main window.": {"translation":"RHI 可以最小化到系统托盘而不是直接关闭。右键托盘图标即可快速启动最近的游戏，无需打开主窗口。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"7042ceb6f8fde94ae4364e3feaa80184bf15bfe41bf9f748a7ecfff1ddb2e9cb"},
  "Enable 'Close to System Tray' in Settings to keep RHI running in the background. The tray icon provides quick access to your most recently played games. RHI automatically checks for updates every 4 hours while running, so everything stays up to date.": {"translation":"在“设置”中启用“关闭到系统托盘”，即可让 RHI 在后台继续运行。托盘图标可快速访问最近玩过的游戏。RHI 运行时每 4 小时自动检查一次更新，以保持内容最新。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"4045cbf4081b60fa4de08b698748981fd72e3ea6fd0dc060de63daf801a2e10a"}
}